---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageBanner from "../components/PageBanner.astro";
import ArrowLink from "../components/ArrowLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Service Partner Terms"
  description="Overview of Atlantis Service Partner Terms for approved providers."
>
  <PageBanner title="Service Partner Terms" image="/images/interior-clean.jpg" />

  <section class="page-body">
    <div class="wrap page-body--narrow legal-body">
      <p class="notice">
        Full legal copy to be supplied and approved. This page outlines the structure of the separate
        Atlantis Service Partner Terms that apply to approved providers — not the public Website Terms.
      </p>
      <p>
        Approved partners must accept the Atlantis Service Partner Terms before onboarding is final.
        Those terms govern the working relationship between Atlantis and its approved partner network,
        including how work may be offered, verification of ABN, licences and insurance, and expectations
        around delivery quality.
      </p>
      <h2>What partners should expect</h2>
      <ul class="page-points">
        <li>Applications are reviewed. Approval does not guarantee a minimum volume of work.</li>
        <li>Atlantis may request extra information or documents at any time.</li>
        <li>
          Future job opportunities and pricing may run through a private Atlantis system — not a public
          marketplace of competing profiles.
        </li>
        <li>Partners are not presented to customers as a directory of providers to compare.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Until the final Partner Terms document is published here, applicants can continue through the
        partner application form. Acceptance of the full terms will be required before onboarding is
        complete.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
        <ArrowLink href="/partners" label="Become a service partner" dark />
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
